# Data Tables & Filtering

## GenericDataGrid

AG Grid wrapper with column visibility toggle, sort/filter per column, RTL, and pagination.

### Server-side (Laravel paginated lists)

```tsx
const { data, isLoading } = useUsersList(page, search, sortBy, sortOrder)

<GenericDataGrid
  rowData={data?.data ?? []}
  isServerSide
  currentPage={page}
  totalPages={data?.meta?.last_page ?? 1}
  onPageChange={setPage}
  paginationLinks={data?.meta?.links}
  loading={isLoading}
/>
```

### Client-side (small static datasets)

Omit `isServerSide`; grid paginates locally with page-size selector.

## useTableState

Use for list pages needing page + search + sort together:

```ts
const table = useTableState({ sortBy: 'created_at', sortOrder: 'desc' })
// table.page, table.search, table.setSearch, table.setPage, table.sortBy, table.setSort
```

## Search

Use `SearchInput`; reset page to 1 when search changes.

## Status filter

Use `StatusDropdown` in forms/grids for active/inactive toggles.
